WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:30.240 --> 00:31.610
I've got my eye on her.

3
00:32.240 --> 00:33.010
Now get lost!

4
01:07.620 --> 01:13.500
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

5
01:15.540 --> 01:21.500
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

6
01:22.540 --> 01:26.780
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

7
01:30.460 --> 01:38.020
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

8
01:38.380 --> 01:45.140
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

9
01:46.380 --> 01:53.020
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

10
01:54.220 --> 02:01.060
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

11
02:02.660 --> 02:09.180
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

12
02:13.940 --> 02:15.740
[Blossom in Darkness]

13
02:15.740 --> 02:17.740
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

14
02:17.740 --> 02:20.740
[Episode 16]

15
02:24.760 --> 02:25.620
Youyou?

16
02:28.520 --> 02:29.970
You came back from 900 years ago, too?

17
02:30.360 --> 02:30.970
How dare you!

18
02:31.870 --> 02:33.370
How do you know my childhood nickname?

19
02:33.870 --> 02:35.530
You will address me as

20
02:35.800 --> 02:36.650
the Demon Queen.

21
02:42.290 --> 02:43.620
This portal leads to the past.

22
02:43.800 --> 02:45.180
Find the mighty ancient demon I used to be.

23
02:45.480 --> 02:46.930
This is our only chance to survive.

24
02:47.280 --> 02:48.920
She'll use her talisman to save you.

25
02:50.150 --> 02:52.970
Has the Saintess of the Tides been born yet?

26
02:54.200 --> 02:56.090
That was ages ago.

27
02:57.150 --> 02:58.610
The Saintess of the Tides

28
02:58.610 --> 03:00.510
was killed a century ago

29
03:00.510 --> 03:01.510
by that devil, Qi Fengyin.

30
03:01.550 --> 03:02.370
What about Qi Fengyin?

31
03:02.990 --> 03:04.530
Sealed away on Mount Qihuang, of course.

32
03:04.870 --> 03:06.690
The Saintess died a century ago.

33
03:07.110 --> 03:07.690
Then that means

34
03:08.140 --> 03:08.860
Youyou sent me

35
03:08.860 --> 03:09.940
900 years into the past.

36
03:16.960 --> 03:18.780
I could smell this rare medicinal fragrance

37
03:18.800 --> 03:20.370
from miles away.

38
03:20.670 --> 03:22.060
Legend speaks of a mystical herb,

39
03:22.110 --> 03:23.340
the Moonlit Revival Herb.

40
03:23.360 --> 03:25.020
It can cure any illness

41
03:25.110 --> 03:26.250
and greatly boost one's cultivation.

42
03:26.590 --> 03:27.530
Good thing I'm not too late.

43
03:27.670 --> 03:28.500
You're not quite dead yet.

44
03:31.420 --> 03:32.770
Your future self, 900 years from now,

45
03:32.800 --> 03:33.870
sent me here

46
03:33.870 --> 03:34.740
to borrow your Demon Soul Talisman.

47
03:34.760 --> 03:35.690
Who are you to even mention

48
03:36.270 --> 03:37.410
the Demon Soul Talisman?

49
03:38.080 --> 03:38.500
I...

50
03:41.060 --> 03:50.340
[Luoliang Demon Capital]

51
03:57.320 --> 03:57.940
Come on!

52
03:58.320 --> 03:59.460
- Wait for me! - Hurry up!

53
04:01.550 --> 04:02.530
I want one, too.

54
04:02.690 --> 04:03.370
I'll take this one.

55
04:06.920 --> 04:08.370
I'm back!

56
04:22.710 --> 04:23.810
Hurry! Let's get out of here!

57
04:33.080 --> 04:33.420
You...

58
04:33.440 --> 04:34.980
Looks like nobody wants you around.

59
04:35.390 --> 04:35.740
Get back!

60
04:36.390 --> 04:37.300
You're about to die,

61
04:37.300 --> 04:38.020
and you still won't stop talking.

62
04:38.320 --> 04:39.810
Believe me, I could eat you right now!

63
04:42.440 --> 04:44.330
Your blood must smell too strong.

64
04:45.000 --> 04:46.370
That's why my demons are in an uproar.

65
04:47.080 --> 04:48.500
I'll have to put another seal on you.

66
05:00.780 --> 05:02.660
[Spring Breeze Pavilion]

67
05:06.100 --> 05:07.900
[Demon Capital Inn]

68
05:16.030 --> 05:16.980
Luoliang Immortal City?

69
05:17.520 --> 05:18.570
What are you talking about?

70
05:21.340 --> 05:24.220
[Luoliang Demon Capital]

71
05:24.910 --> 05:26.450
This is my Luoliang Demon Capital.

72
05:26.830 --> 05:28.370
I built this entire city myself.

73
05:28.830 --> 05:29.740
This is my territory.

74
05:39.080 --> 05:40.130
Nothing pleases me more

75
05:40.150 --> 05:41.860
than collecting gold and treasure.

76
05:42.230 --> 05:43.770
These are my prized possessions.

77
05:43.910 --> 05:45.130
The more I hoard, the safer I feel.

78
05:45.610 --> 05:47.630
And now you're part of my collection.

79
05:48.230 --> 05:49.210
The Moonlit Revival Herb

80
05:49.660 --> 05:50.800
is a rare treasure.

81
05:51.150 --> 05:52.880
New Year's Eve is almost here.

82
05:53.200 --> 05:54.720
I'll chop you to pieces

83
05:54.720 --> 05:55.790
and make a lavish feast of you.

84
05:55.830 --> 05:56.900
Every demon in the capital

85
05:56.900 --> 05:58.100
will get a share.

86
05:58.440 --> 05:59.860
You'll only bring trouble on yourself.

87
06:01.120 --> 06:01.820
900 years from now,

88
06:01.820 --> 06:02.940
you'll face a terrible calamity.

89
06:03.320 --> 06:04.420
Your only hope is to use the Demon Soul Talisman

90
06:04.520 --> 06:05.470
to open a portal through time

91
06:05.470 --> 06:06.420
and escape.

92
06:06.710 --> 06:07.600
You sent me back here,

93
06:07.640 --> 06:09.060
but you're still in danger.

94
06:09.200 --> 06:09.790
Youyou.

95
06:09.880 --> 06:11.690
Helping me now means saving yourself.

96
06:12.960 --> 06:13.810
Let me get this straight.

97
06:14.150 --> 06:15.250
You're saying

98
06:15.590 --> 06:16.940
that 900 years from now,

99
06:17.200 --> 06:18.100
to protect you,

100
06:18.270 --> 06:19.690
I opened a portal through time.

101
06:19.880 --> 06:21.060
And after sending you here,

102
06:21.200 --> 06:22.210
my future self

103
06:22.560 --> 06:23.860
is waiting for you to come save me?

104
06:27.320 --> 06:28.880
Nobody knows me better than I do.

105
06:28.960 --> 06:29.660
Why would I ever

106
06:29.680 --> 06:30.820
use the talisman's power

107
06:30.880 --> 06:31.950
for something like that?

108
06:32.350 --> 06:32.620
You...

109
06:32.680 --> 06:34.010
- I... - Even if that's true,

110
06:34.110 --> 06:35.290
my future self

111
06:35.290 --> 06:36.080
must have tricked you

112
06:36.080 --> 06:36.900
into coming here

113
06:36.900 --> 06:37.930
just to have you for dinner.

114
06:38.190 --> 06:38.780
Don't worry.

115
06:38.800 --> 06:39.680
I know a delicacy when I see one.

116
06:39.830 --> 06:41.100
When the time comes, I won't waste

117
06:41.120 --> 06:41.980
even a single strand of your hair.

118
06:42.630 --> 06:43.100
No, listen!

119
06:43.190 --> 06:43.700
If either one of us

120
06:43.720 --> 06:44.840
were lying,

121
06:44.840 --> 06:46.250
there's no way I could be here!

122
06:48.160 --> 06:49.050
If your future self

123
06:49.070 --> 06:50.140
could just eat me,

124
06:50.430 --> 06:51.290
why go through all that trouble

125
06:51.310 --> 06:52.100
to send me back here?

126
06:52.360 --> 06:52.980
Good point.

127
06:53.390 --> 06:54.100
Why bother?

128
06:54.680 --> 06:56.610
That's exactly why I don't believe

129
06:56.720 --> 06:58.290
a word of your story about 900 years

130
06:58.310 --> 06:59.610
or even 9,000 years from now.

131
07:02.680 --> 07:03.410
And another thing.

132
07:05.360 --> 07:06.640
If you dare mention

133
07:06.640 --> 07:08.180
the Demon Soul Talisman again,

134
07:08.720 --> 07:10.220
I'll cut out your tongue and eat it.

135
07:19.230 --> 07:20.060
The Demon Soul Talisman clearly

136
07:20.060 --> 07:21.430
has the power to open portals through time.

137
07:21.870 --> 07:23.660
Why won't Youyou believe me?

138
07:25.720 --> 07:27.170
And now I've lost track of Qi Fengyin.

139
07:27.870 --> 07:29.370
Youyou is in the Saintess's hands.

140
07:29.480 --> 07:30.800
Not sure how things are going.

141
07:35.240 --> 07:35.880
I have to find a way

142
07:35.880 --> 07:37.020
to escape from here.

143
08:04.040 --> 08:04.930
This magical artifact is completely

144
08:04.950 --> 08:05.970
unaffected by spiritual power.

145
08:12.480 --> 08:13.250
Master...

146
08:34.870 --> 08:35.940
This is all my fault.

147
08:37.360 --> 08:39.100
I wasted too much time.

148
08:40.080 --> 08:41.820
I was so close.

149
08:54.870 --> 08:56.180
If you're going to eat me, just do it!

150
08:56.440 --> 08:57.460
Stop wasting time.

151
09:00.000 --> 09:00.700
It's me.

152
09:13.870 --> 09:15.940
A demon spell was masking the scent of your blood.

153
09:17.150 --> 09:18.220
It took quite a bit of effort

154
09:18.270 --> 09:19.060
to track you down.

155
09:19.790 --> 09:20.490
And while I was at it,

156
09:20.790 --> 09:22.340
I found some ointment for your wounds.

157
09:55.360 --> 09:56.730
You've already done more than enough.

158
09:59.080 --> 10:01.530
But I've tried so hard.

159
10:03.320 --> 10:04.640
I've done everything

160
10:04.640 --> 10:06.120
I could possibly think of.

161
10:07.000 --> 10:08.820
But no matter what I try,

162
10:09.840 --> 10:12.010
it all ends up being for nothing.

163
10:12.630 --> 10:14.340
When I left Luoshen Valley,

164
10:14.910 --> 10:15.700
I never imagined

165
10:15.750 --> 10:16.690
the journey to Mount Zhaowu

166
10:16.690 --> 10:17.700
would be this long.

167
10:19.670 --> 10:21.610
It feels like there's no end in sight.

168
10:25.200 --> 10:26.340
And now Master is...

169
10:38.440 --> 10:40.060
Destroy my spirit.

170
10:40.840 --> 10:41.770
Take this body

171
10:41.790 --> 10:42.730
and go find the malice you need.

172
10:43.390 --> 10:44.220
Qi Fengyin.

173
10:46.960 --> 10:47.580
I'm tired.

174
10:52.200 --> 10:53.300
Did you really come all this way

175
10:53.320 --> 10:54.850
just to save your master?

176
11:10.790 --> 11:11.580
My ring...

177
11:13.360 --> 11:14.940
When Master's soul crystal

178
11:15.000 --> 11:15.700
stopped responding,

179
11:16.270 --> 11:17.770
I thought the ring had vanished with it.

180
11:17.910 --> 11:19.250
There should still be someone

181
11:19.910 --> 11:20.940
who can save Danshen.

182
11:23.790 --> 11:24.980
We're 900 years in the past.

183
11:25.030 --> 11:26.070
Master is still alive!

184
11:26.150 --> 11:27.600
Find him in Luoshen Valley.

185
11:28.200 --> 11:29.250
Maybe he can be awakened.

186
11:32.270 --> 11:32.700
I...

187
11:42.600 --> 11:44.180
These shackles can only hold one person.

188
11:49.870 --> 11:50.650
It's all right.

189
11:51.270 --> 11:52.300
I still have some power left.

190
11:52.790 --> 11:53.730
But you're no match

191
11:53.750 --> 11:54.710
for Youyou as she is now.

192
11:55.120 --> 11:56.100
What if she finds out

193
11:56.320 --> 11:58.100
you're staying here in my place?

194
12:06.870 --> 12:08.220
This way, she won't be able to tell.

195
12:19.790 --> 12:20.730
You must be careful.

196
12:21.670 --> 12:22.890
Don't let Youyou eat you.

197
12:25.360 --> 12:26.770
I just need a little more time

198
12:27.080 --> 12:28.370
to bring the Wanjun Lock under control.

199
12:28.870 --> 12:30.130
Don't worry about me once you leave.

200
12:30.510 --> 12:31.420
And don't come back.

201
13:16.240 --> 13:16.820
What happened

202
13:17.080 --> 13:18.250
between you two 1,000 years ago

203
13:18.510 --> 13:19.940
that makes you so determined to kill him?

204
13:20.270 --> 13:21.180
This has nothing to do with a grudge.

205
13:21.720 --> 13:23.130
It's our destiny.

206
13:23.750 --> 13:24.420
Destiny?

207
13:25.960 --> 13:27.730
Before I was sealed on Mount Qihuang,

208
13:29.390 --> 13:30.820
what exactly happened?

209
13:42.390 --> 13:43.220
Luoshen Valley.

210
13:44.600 --> 13:45.460
I'm finally back.

211
13:59.320 --> 14:00.330
Why does this place look

212
14:00.330 --> 14:01.600
like no one's ever been here?

213
14:03.320 --> 14:04.890
Master guarded this mountain for a thousand years.

214
14:05.550 --> 14:06.750
By now, he should

215
14:06.750 --> 14:07.980
already be here in Luoshen Valley.

216
14:08.270 --> 14:09.650
Master's residence is gone.

217
14:11.030 --> 14:11.770
The library is gone.

218
14:12.390 --> 14:13.420
Even the garden pavilion is gone.

219
14:16.840 --> 14:17.370
How is this possible?

220
14:21.240 --> 14:22.580
The Saintess's Shrine.

221
14:23.630 --> 14:24.340
As long as the shrine is here,

222
14:24.870 --> 14:25.700
he must be here too.

223
14:47.510 --> 14:48.530
Where's the shrine?

224
14:51.120 --> 14:52.490
Even the shrine is gone.

225
16:06.320 --> 16:06.980
Miss.

226
16:13.510 --> 16:14.250
Master?

227
16:20.790 --> 16:21.420
Miss.

228
16:21.840 --> 16:23.850
What brings you to this deserted place?

229
16:28.220 --> 16:33.460
♪The past has left its scars upon my eyes♪

230
16:33.940 --> 16:39.940
♪The wind brings yet more sorrow...♪

231
16:44.750 --> 16:45.460
Master.

232
16:46.840 --> 16:47.460
It seems

233
16:48.120 --> 16:48.890
you and I

234
16:49.440 --> 16:50.730
already know each other.

235
16:55.300 --> 17:00.860
♪How can I forget the love we shared?♪

236
17:01.340 --> 17:06.460
♪Our story is suddenly shrouded in sorrow♪

237
17:07.140 --> 17:12.780
♪The dream drags on. Looking back breaks my heart♪

238
17:13.220 --> 17:18.420
♪In the end, all we had fades into nothing♪

239
17:30.920 --> 17:32.010
This place is protected by a seal.

240
17:32.510 --> 17:34.330
Even if an outsider wanders in by accident,

241
17:34.550 --> 17:35.570
they won't see its true appearance.

242
17:36.400 --> 17:37.180
They'll simply think it's

243
17:37.590 --> 17:39.330
a remote, deserted valley.

244
17:56.070 --> 17:56.980
Feeling better?

245
18:03.070 --> 18:05.290
I never imagined there was an artifact

246
18:05.640 --> 18:06.900
that could reach into the past

247
18:07.310 --> 18:08.420
and travel through time.

248
18:09.110 --> 18:09.460
Mas...

249
18:11.830 --> 18:13.180
You believe what I've told you?

250
18:13.590 --> 18:14.180
Of course.

251
18:14.790 --> 18:16.600
Near the Saintess's Shrine,

252
18:16.660 --> 18:17.750
there is indeed a mystical herb.

253
18:17.960 --> 18:18.980
It hasn't taken human form yet,

254
18:19.750 --> 18:21.380
but it has the same aura as you.

255
18:25.880 --> 18:27.050
You came all this way to find me.

256
18:27.880 --> 18:28.570
You must've

257
18:29.240 --> 18:30.490
had a rough time, too.

258
18:38.270 --> 18:39.090
900 years from now,

259
18:39.720 --> 18:41.010
you'll face a terrible calamity.

260
18:41.200 --> 18:42.770
Your energy will be drained, and your body will wither.

261
18:43.240 --> 18:44.330
You'll turn into this soul crystal.

262
18:44.590 --> 18:45.900
I've tried so many ways to save you,

263
18:46.160 --> 18:47.530
but I still can't awaken it.

264
18:49.680 --> 18:51.050
The crystal hasn't been damaged at all.

265
18:51.310 --> 18:52.220
But half a month ago,

266
18:52.270 --> 18:53.050
my connection to it

267
18:53.050 --> 18:54.380
started growing weaker and weaker.

268
18:54.880 --> 18:55.570
And now,

269
18:55.960 --> 18:56.660
I can't even sense

270
18:56.680 --> 18:57.900
the slightest response from it.

271
18:58.790 --> 18:59.420
Master,

272
18:59.920 --> 19:01.090
can this soul crystal still be restored?

273
19:03.200 --> 19:04.330
Sealed inside it

274
19:04.480 --> 19:05.570
is my own soul.

275
19:06.160 --> 19:07.380
Even I'm not worried.

276
19:07.680 --> 19:08.810
Why are you so frightened?

277
19:16.000 --> 19:16.730
Right now,

278
19:17.310 --> 19:19.050
I'm still just a wild herb without human form.

279
19:20.310 --> 19:21.330
You haven't met me yet,

280
19:22.000 --> 19:22.860
so you couldn't possibly know

281
19:23.160 --> 19:24.900
what we'll go through together.

282
19:27.480 --> 19:28.900
I care more about your safety

283
19:29.680 --> 19:31.180
than anyone else in this world.

284
19:35.830 --> 19:36.940
What a strange twist of fate.

285
19:37.720 --> 19:38.770
Now I have to

286
19:39.400 --> 19:41.050
save myself 900 years in the future.

287
19:43.400 --> 19:44.220
Master, does that mean

288
19:44.510 --> 19:45.090
you can save it?

289
19:45.590 --> 19:46.250
No one else could.

290
19:46.640 --> 19:47.220
Fortunately,

291
19:47.440 --> 19:48.770
it was brought to me.

292
19:49.160 --> 19:51.180
That gives my future self a chance to survive.

293
19:56.110 --> 19:57.050
The Moonlit Revival Herb

294
19:57.440 --> 19:58.250
awakens when the moon rises

295
19:58.510 --> 19:59.290
and rests when the moon sets.

296
19:59.680 --> 20:01.700
You must be exhausted by now.

297
20:02.160 --> 20:02.860
Restoring the soul crystal

298
20:02.860 --> 20:04.180
will take some time.

299
20:04.480 --> 20:05.570
You don't have to stay awake waiting for me.

300
20:05.920 --> 20:06.420
No!

301
20:07.160 --> 20:08.380
This is the most critical moment.

302
20:08.480 --> 20:09.330
I've made it this far.

303
20:09.590 --> 20:09.980
I'm not sleeping.

304
20:10.160 --> 20:11.220
I'll wait right here.

305
21:16.790 --> 21:18.010
So that's how things

306
21:19.160 --> 21:20.620
turned out 900 years from now.

307
21:21.240 --> 21:22.050
Interesting.

308
21:39.350 --> 21:40.220
Qi Fengyin.

309
22:08.070 --> 22:08.860
I thought

310
22:08.880 --> 22:10.330
you'd raise a huge fuss last night.

311
22:11.240 --> 22:13.050
But you slept like nothing was wrong.

312
22:17.830 --> 22:18.980
How dare you glare at me!

313
22:21.480 --> 22:22.890
I'll make a meal of you today.

314
22:23.200 --> 22:23.700
Go on.

315
22:24.480 --> 22:25.460
Any last words?

316
22:32.400 --> 22:32.980
Master?

317
22:34.270 --> 22:35.490
Why are you up

318
22:35.750 --> 22:36.530
after only half a day's rest?

319
22:40.160 --> 22:41.460
Master, where did you go?

320
22:42.640 --> 22:43.940
You seem terribly weak.

321
22:44.830 --> 22:45.860
So I used some spiritual power

322
22:45.880 --> 22:46.860
to make you something to eat.

323
22:47.200 --> 22:48.090
This valley is quite remote.

324
22:48.270 --> 22:50.220
I could only find wild fruit to use.

325
22:50.510 --> 22:52.460
I'm afraid it may not suit your taste.

326
22:55.350 --> 22:55.980
Master,

327
22:56.720 --> 22:57.970
how's the soul crystal coming along?

328
22:58.110 --> 22:59.010
Is there anything I can do to help?

329
23:01.070 --> 23:02.730
I've already awakened the soul crystal.

330
23:03.030 --> 23:04.140
With my powers sustaining it,

331
23:04.350 --> 23:05.570
it only needs a little more time

332
23:05.790 --> 23:07.090
to fully recover

333
23:07.400 --> 23:08.180
and regain human form.

334
23:11.480 --> 23:13.700
But the spiritual energy

335
23:14.000 --> 23:15.700
of the past and present

336
23:15.880 --> 23:16.620
isn't quite the same.

337
23:17.110 --> 23:18.980
I'm afraid he won't fully regain consciousness

338
23:19.790 --> 23:20.220
until

339
23:20.590 --> 23:22.220
you return to your own time.

340
23:24.160 --> 23:25.140
So...

341
23:25.880 --> 23:26.620
I still need to find a way

342
23:26.680 --> 23:27.730
back to the present.

343
23:31.050 --> 23:31.700
Master!

344
23:37.070 --> 23:37.980
Let me take a look.

345
23:50.200 --> 23:51.770
Since this calamity was fated,

346
23:52.110 --> 23:53.050
escaping it

347
23:53.350 --> 23:54.810
was bound to come at a price.

348
23:55.550 --> 23:57.700
I've sacrificed half my immortal core

349
23:57.880 --> 23:58.860
and half a lifetime of cultivation.

350
23:59.790 --> 24:00.700
But at least I've ensured

351
24:01.310 --> 24:03.140
that I'll still be alive 900 years from now.

352
24:03.590 --> 24:04.570
You have nothing to blame yourself for.

353
24:05.160 --> 24:07.140
And there's no need to be sad.

354
24:10.070 --> 24:11.250
So Master's deep-seated weakness

355
24:11.510 --> 24:12.460
started

356
24:13.310 --> 24:14.770
right here, in this moment.

357
24:16.920 --> 24:18.180
Just knowing that one day

358
24:18.440 --> 24:19.770
I'll have such a wonderful disciple,

359
24:20.240 --> 24:22.050
willing to brave anything to save me,

360
24:22.200 --> 24:23.220
makes 900 years of illness

361
24:23.350 --> 24:24.250
seem like nothing at all.

362
24:24.750 --> 24:25.330
At least

363
24:25.510 --> 24:26.530
it all ends well,

364
24:26.960 --> 24:27.530
doesn't it?

365
24:31.880 --> 24:32.380
All right.

366
24:32.440 --> 24:33.290
You're still injured.

367
24:33.510 --> 24:35.010
Stay in Luoshen Valley and rest.

368
24:35.400 --> 24:36.770
I'll clear some space

369
24:36.960 --> 24:38.010
and build you a place to stay.

370
24:38.310 --> 24:38.940
Master.

371
24:43.590 --> 24:44.250
What is it?

372
24:44.830 --> 24:45.980
Don't you want to stay with me?

373
24:47.200 --> 24:47.730
I do.

374
24:50.000 --> 24:50.940
But there's someone

375
24:51.830 --> 24:52.770
I'm worried about.

376
24:53.640 --> 24:54.530
I have to find him.

377
24:57.200 --> 24:59.250
It seems this person

378
24:59.680 --> 25:00.420
means a great deal to you.

379
25:04.900 --> 25:05.730
In that case,

380
25:06.070 --> 25:07.380
I won't make you stay.

381
25:08.200 --> 25:08.770
Go on, then.

382
25:13.030 --> 25:13.660
Master.

383
25:14.110 --> 25:14.860
Once I leave,

384
25:15.070 --> 25:15.860
we won't meet again

385
25:16.270 --> 25:17.420
for hundreds of years.

386
25:17.680 --> 25:18.460
When you see me again,

387
25:19.070 --> 25:20.570
promise you won't send me to Mount Zhaowu.

388
25:35.920 --> 25:36.900
I gave you

389
25:36.920 --> 25:38.420
all night to think.

390
25:40.030 --> 25:40.980
Still no last words?

391
25:41.310 --> 25:42.490
Then have you decided whether you want to be

392
25:42.510 --> 25:43.420
sweet and sour or braised?

393
25:50.480 --> 25:51.900
If you can't decide,

394
25:52.160 --> 25:52.860
I'll just make you

395
25:52.960 --> 25:54.220
the way I like it.

396
26:07.750 --> 26:09.860
I was only trying to scare you yesterday.

397
26:10.160 --> 26:11.490
I didn't actually cut out your tongue.

398
26:11.750 --> 26:13.090
So why can't you say a word?

399
26:17.750 --> 26:19.290
Did I scare you senseless?

400
26:21.830 --> 26:22.860
If I eat a fool,

401
26:23.110 --> 26:24.140
will I turn into one too?

402
26:47.680 --> 26:48.980
I was waiting for my powers to recover.

403
26:49.640 --> 26:50.530
What were you waiting for?

404
27:03.400 --> 27:04.530
It's been a full day and night.

405
27:05.310 --> 27:06.730
I hope Qi Fengyin is all right.

406
27:18.070 --> 27:20.290
I can't believe you dared to come back.

407
27:39.160 --> 27:40.180
Now that's the right aura.

408
27:40.830 --> 27:42.010
Finally, the real one.

409
27:42.350 --> 27:43.050
Did she figure out

410
27:43.070 --> 27:43.980
that Qi Fengyin

411
27:44.000 --> 27:44.660
was impersonating me?

412
27:44.790 --> 27:45.220
Talk.

413
27:45.550 --> 27:47.400
What's your connection to Qi Fengyin?

414
27:47.450 --> 27:47.850
You...

415
27:48.030 --> 27:49.420
How do you know he was Qi Fengyin?

416
27:51.310 --> 27:52.530
That was Qi Fengyin!

417
27:52.790 --> 27:53.440
The most vicious devil

418
27:53.440 --> 27:55.010
in the entire world.

419
27:55.240 --> 27:56.420
He can do just about anything,

420
27:56.440 --> 27:56.810
all right?

421
27:56.950 --> 27:58.290
The leaders of the Five Great Sects...

422
27:58.310 --> 27:59.530
Even together, they couldn't beat him.

423
28:00.350 --> 28:01.380
Remember the Saintess of the Tides?

424
28:01.440 --> 28:02.380
The one you asked me about the other day?

425
28:03.070 --> 28:04.490
Even she couldn't defeat Qi Fengyin.

426
28:04.640 --> 28:06.420
She could only seal him on Mount Qihuang.

427
28:06.750 --> 28:07.620
But who would've thought

428
28:07.620 --> 28:09.290
he'd break the divine seal

429
28:09.350 --> 28:10.310
and come all the way here

430
28:10.920 --> 28:12.050
to take your place in confinement?

431
28:12.830 --> 28:14.180
What's your relationship with him?

432
28:15.110 --> 28:16.380
Why do you sound like

433
28:16.680 --> 28:17.900
you admire him so much?

434
28:20.070 --> 28:22.090
So he's gone now?

435
28:22.350 --> 28:22.980
Of course.

436
28:23.070 --> 28:23.810
I couldn't beat him.

437
28:24.070 --> 28:25.220
I personally escorted him out.

438
28:26.070 --> 28:27.900
He's brought the Wanjun Lock under control?

439
28:28.830 --> 28:30.220
Now that he's free,

440
28:31.110 --> 28:32.490
I can use his reputation

441
28:32.510 --> 28:33.380
to keep Youyou in check.

442
28:43.720 --> 28:45.490
You know he's the most powerful

443
28:45.510 --> 28:47.140
devil in the world.

444
28:47.440 --> 28:49.010
No one's ever been able to defeat him.

445
28:49.310 --> 28:50.730
Yet he willingly let himself be locked

446
28:51.070 --> 28:52.420
in that stone chamber for me.

447
28:53.920 --> 28:55.490
What do you think that makes us?

448
28:56.000 --> 28:56.810
What does it make you?

449
29:02.400 --> 29:03.290
He's in love with me.

450
29:06.510 --> 29:07.860
Qi Fengyin

451
29:08.960 --> 29:10.210
is wrapped around

452
29:10.920 --> 29:12.140
my little finger.

453
29:12.640 --> 29:14.040
He can't resist my charms.

454
29:14.040 --> 29:14.940
He's completely obsessed with me.

455
29:15.550 --> 29:17.250
That's why wherever I go,

456
29:17.310 --> 29:18.180
he follows.

457
29:19.920 --> 29:21.590
So when you said yesterday

458
29:21.640 --> 29:23.490
you came back from 900 years in the future,

459
29:23.640 --> 29:24.420
you really were lying to me.

460
29:24.790 --> 29:25.490
Of course not!

461
29:25.830 --> 29:26.180
I...

462
29:27.350 --> 29:29.010
I've just been back for a while.

463
29:29.400 --> 29:30.900
I wandered onto Mount Qihuang

464
29:31.350 --> 29:32.330
and happened to meet Qi Fengyin.

465
29:32.510 --> 29:34.900
It was love at first sight for him!

466
29:35.070 --> 29:36.330
He's utterly devoted to me.

467
29:36.720 --> 29:38.090
He treats me like his greatest treasure.

468
29:38.640 --> 29:39.380
So,

469
29:40.110 --> 29:41.570
if you dare eat me,

470
29:41.880 --> 29:43.940
Qi Fengyin will never let you get away with it.

471
29:46.720 --> 29:47.770
She's letting me go just like that?

472
29:48.560 --> 29:50.760
Is Qi Fengyin's name really that powerful,

473
29:51.000 --> 29:52.570
or is this Youyou just...

474
29:53.070 --> 29:54.530
I've decided not to eat you.

475
29:55.570 --> 29:56.830
With Qi Fengyin around,

476
29:56.830 --> 29:57.890
you couldn't eat me anyway.

477
29:57.920 --> 29:59.470
Didn't you say

478
29:59.480 --> 30:00.620
you wanted to use the talisman's power

479
30:00.640 --> 30:01.760
to return 900 years into the future?

480
30:02.240 --> 30:02.980
I'll help you.

481
30:03.830 --> 30:05.420
But I have one condition.

482
30:07.160 --> 30:07.860
What condition?

483
30:08.070 --> 30:10.330
I'm appointing you as my advisor.

484
30:22.000 --> 30:23.250
There's plenty of spiritual energy here.

485
30:23.680 --> 30:24.150
This must be

486
30:24.150 --> 30:25.620
a minor sect under the Five Great Sects.

487
30:26.200 --> 30:27.180
Why did you bring me here?

488
30:53.420 --> 30:57.500
[Shen Wangyan, Leader of Yunyi Sect]

489
31:03.070 --> 31:03.660
You came all this way

490
31:03.680 --> 31:04.770
just to see that man?

491
31:08.240 --> 31:08.940
Who is he?

492
31:10.160 --> 31:11.380
The leader of Yunyi Sect,

493
31:11.480 --> 31:12.290
Shen Wangyan.

494
31:13.110 --> 31:13.900
His zither playing

495
31:14.070 --> 31:15.420
is so beautiful.

496
31:16.350 --> 31:17.050
And he's

497
31:17.160 --> 31:18.460
quite handsome, too.

498
31:22.750 --> 31:24.030
You actually have a thing for

499
31:24.030 --> 31:25.030
a cultivator?

500
31:25.640 --> 31:26.140
Didn't you used to

501
31:26.480 --> 31:27.980
hate the way those immortals smelled?

502
31:28.310 --> 31:29.180
You even called it

503
31:29.510 --> 31:30.530
their immortal stink.

504
31:32.270 --> 31:32.940
What are you talking about?

505
31:33.350 --> 31:34.570
Don't you dare talk about Shen Wangyan like that.

506
31:35.240 --> 31:36.090
You have no taste.

507
31:51.920 --> 31:52.460
Come on, let's go.

508
32:03.880 --> 32:05.090
What

509
32:05.880 --> 32:07.140
do you think

510
32:07.960 --> 32:08.530
of Shen Wangyan?

511
32:09.480 --> 32:10.490
You like him?

512
32:14.070 --> 32:15.940
I made you my advisor

513
32:16.160 --> 32:17.660
because you managed to win over

514
32:17.680 --> 32:18.690
the most ruthless man alive,

515
32:18.690 --> 32:19.860
Qi Fengyin.

516
32:20.160 --> 32:21.530
You can surely help me marry Shen Wangyan.

517
32:22.960 --> 32:23.330
You...

518
32:23.920 --> 32:24.180
I...

519
32:26.240 --> 32:27.530
You want to marry him?

520
32:28.550 --> 32:30.220
But he's the leader of an immortal sect!

521
32:30.790 --> 32:31.570
It's a tiny sect.

522
32:31.590 --> 32:32.620
There aren't many disciples anyway.

523
32:34.720 --> 32:35.620
But immortals and demons

524
32:35.680 --> 32:36.620
have been enemies for ages.

525
32:36.880 --> 32:38.290
How can you fall for an immortal?

526
32:38.310 --> 32:40.010
You're so old-fashioned!

527
32:42.440 --> 32:43.480
He's good to me,

528
32:43.480 --> 32:44.700
so of course I like him.

529
32:45.030 --> 32:46.980
That's why I'm going to marry him

530
32:47.030 --> 32:48.180
and make him my Demon King Consort.

531
32:51.070 --> 32:52.090
How has he been good to you?

532
32:54.480 --> 32:55.620
You know how much I love

533
32:55.640 --> 32:56.620
collecting things like

534
32:56.720 --> 32:57.730
gold and jewels,

535
32:57.750 --> 32:59.090
and legendary magical artifacts,

536
32:59.110 --> 32:59.860
right?

537
32:59.920 --> 33:01.900
Well, I heard Yunyi Sect had

538
33:01.900 --> 33:03.220
a legendary Floating Shadow Zither.

539
33:03.550 --> 33:05.460
And it's close to Luoliang Demon Capital.

540
33:05.830 --> 33:08.570
So one day, I snuck over to steal it.

541
33:55.960 --> 33:57.140
This place is guarded by powerful arrays.

542
33:57.880 --> 33:58.870
If this spiritual power strikes

543
33:58.870 --> 33:59.660
an ordinary person,

544
33:59.920 --> 34:00.770
it'll feel like a normal blow.

545
34:01.030 --> 34:01.730
But for demons,

546
34:01.750 --> 34:02.810
the pain cuts right to the bone.

547
34:03.000 --> 34:04.220
You shouldn't have barged in here.

548
34:05.750 --> 34:07.090
I've got my eye on this zither.

549
34:07.350 --> 34:08.130
And I'm taking it!

550
34:13.510 --> 34:13.900
Don't move.

551
34:53.840 --> 34:54.820
How are you feeling, miss?

552
35:02.360 --> 35:02.980
All better.

553
35:05.710 --> 35:06.570
This Floating Shadow Zither

554
35:06.710 --> 35:08.130
is our sect's sacred heirloom.

555
35:08.670 --> 35:09.860
Only the sect leaders

556
35:10.110 --> 35:11.610
and their wives may play it.

557
35:12.150 --> 35:13.340
Then I'll marry you!

558
35:16.550 --> 35:17.530
You're certainly

559
35:18.360 --> 35:19.260
very straightforward.

560
35:31.990 --> 35:34.100
So you two got engaged?

561
35:36.960 --> 35:38.100
If it were that easy

562
35:38.100 --> 35:38.930
to get engaged,

563
35:38.930 --> 35:40.010
why would I need you?

564
35:40.670 --> 35:42.420
Then he said I couldn't take a hint

565
35:42.710 --> 35:44.260
and threw me out of Yunyi Sect.

566
35:45.480 --> 35:47.050
It's just a zither.

567
35:47.360 --> 35:48.660
You'd actually marry Shen Wangyan

568
35:48.710 --> 35:49.800
just for a zither?

569
35:49.840 --> 35:50.420
Is it really worth it?

570
35:50.590 --> 35:52.090
Isn't that a little foolish?

571
35:52.480 --> 35:53.810
It's not about the zither!

572
35:53.810 --> 35:54.980
It's about the man!

573
35:55.230 --> 35:56.050
Shen Wangyan!

574
35:59.280 --> 36:00.010
Anyway, that day,

575
36:00.280 --> 36:01.610
I was fully prepared

576
36:01.630 --> 36:03.060
to put up a fight

577
36:03.060 --> 36:03.890
if I had to.

578
36:04.110 --> 36:05.090
But to my surprise,

579
36:06.080 --> 36:07.850
he didn't even hold it against me

580
36:07.850 --> 36:09.690
that I'd tried to steal his sect's sacred treasure.

581
36:10.030 --> 36:11.050
He even treated my wounds.

582
36:12.550 --> 36:14.030
He's honestly the only person

583
36:14.130 --> 36:15.530
I've ever met who was kind to me.

584
36:15.920 --> 36:17.700
What's wrong with me liking someone

585
36:17.700 --> 36:18.530
who treats me well?

586
36:18.880 --> 36:19.650
Nothing at all.

587
36:21.030 --> 36:22.570
You're the Demon Queen.

588
36:23.000 --> 36:24.940
The entire Luoliang Demon Capital is yours.

589
36:25.110 --> 36:27.690
Your people adore and support you.

590
36:28.150 --> 36:29.530
How could no one treat you well?

591
36:32.510 --> 36:34.490
Those demons...

592
36:35.320 --> 36:35.940
I captured them

593
36:35.960 --> 36:36.650
and locked them inside the city.

594
36:37.510 --> 36:38.410
You captured them

595
36:38.410 --> 36:39.210
and locked them all up?

596
36:41.590 --> 36:43.650
I was just so lonely

597
36:43.670 --> 36:45.090
that I built Luoliang Demon Capital.

598
36:45.630 --> 36:46.010
Yes,

599
36:46.230 --> 36:49.010
I did capture some demons

600
36:49.030 --> 36:49.650
and lock them up here.

601
36:50.190 --> 36:52.010
But I wanted to be the kind of...

602
36:52.190 --> 36:53.380
loved and admired

603
36:53.400 --> 36:54.820
by every demon in my kingdom.

604
36:55.070 --> 36:56.090
But no matter how much

605
36:56.110 --> 36:57.050
gold and treasure I give them,

606
36:57.070 --> 36:58.090
they're still terrified of me.

607
36:58.150 --> 36:58.940
I can't do anything about it.

608
36:59.480 --> 37:00.570
So I think

609
37:00.840 --> 37:01.860
I need someone

610
37:02.030 --> 37:03.210
like Shen Wangyan,

611
37:03.440 --> 37:04.610
a kind and virtuous Demon King Consort,

612
37:04.760 --> 37:06.300
to help me run Luoliang Demon Capital.

613
37:06.800 --> 37:07.980
But if you marry an immortal

614
37:08.030 --> 37:08.860
and make him your consort,

615
37:09.630 --> 37:11.050
won't your people be even more scared?

616
37:11.590 --> 37:12.050
Of course not.

617
37:12.150 --> 37:13.740
Shen Wangyan doesn't hate demons.

618
37:13.920 --> 37:15.050
If he can be so gentle with me,

619
37:15.110 --> 37:15.940
he can surely treat them

620
37:15.940 --> 37:16.590
just as kindly.

621
37:16.670 --> 37:17.530
Compared to him,

622
37:17.590 --> 37:18.740
they're much more afraid of me.

623
37:25.710 --> 37:26.490
Why are they

624
37:26.510 --> 37:27.210
so scared of you?

625
37:27.840 --> 37:28.530
What exactly

626
37:28.960 --> 37:29.780
is your true form?

627
37:36.110 --> 37:37.210
Anyway, whatever it takes.

628
37:37.960 --> 37:38.980
As long as you help me

629
37:39.030 --> 37:40.010
marry Shen Wangyan,

630
37:40.480 --> 37:42.130
I'll use the talisman to send you back.

631
37:42.510 --> 37:44.530
The question is, can you pull it off?

632
37:44.760 --> 37:45.530
Of course.

633
37:50.070 --> 37:50.740
I

634
37:51.960 --> 37:53.180
know how to handle men.

635
37:53.340 --> 37:54.490
There's not a man alive

636
37:55.000 --> 37:56.740
who can resist my charms.

637
38:18.070 --> 38:19.050
Master is safe now.

638
38:19.840 --> 38:21.210
I just have to wait for him to wake up.

639
38:36.190 --> 38:37.570
Where could Qi Fengyin

640
38:38.280 --> 38:39.380
have gone after escaping

641
38:39.440 --> 38:40.130
the treasure chamber?

642
38:41.110 --> 38:42.820
The Wanjun Lock is incredibly powerful.

643
38:43.710 --> 38:44.860
Can he really keep it under control?

644
38:49.820 --> 38:54.220
[Huanxia Pavilion]

645
39:00.550 --> 39:01.570
At this time of year,

646
39:02.190 --> 39:03.860
the Wish Tree should appear soon.

647
39:04.630 --> 39:05.740
If I want to get the talisman back,

648
39:06.590 --> 39:07.690
I'll have to help win

649
39:08.030 --> 39:09.650
Shen Wangyan's heart before then.

650
39:12.480 --> 39:13.810
I wonder if Youyou in the present

651
39:13.810 --> 39:14.690
can hold on that long.

652
39:18.880 --> 39:19.820
This is going to be tough.

653
39:37.840 --> 39:38.860
You already escaped.

654
39:39.230 --> 39:40.130
Why did you come back?

655
39:41.000 --> 39:42.130
Youyou is a mighty demon now.

656
39:42.360 --> 39:42.980
There's no bond

657
39:43.000 --> 39:43.900
between us at all.

658
39:44.400 --> 39:45.050
Knowing her,

659
39:45.440 --> 39:46.130
she could decide

660
39:46.150 --> 39:46.860
to kill you at any moment.

661
39:47.320 --> 39:48.740
How could I let you die in my place?

662
39:51.960 --> 39:53.460
You came back because you were worried about me?

663
40:01.590 --> 40:03.340
I thought once you saw your master,

664
40:04.230 --> 40:05.460
you'd stay in Luoshen Valley

665
40:05.960 --> 40:06.860
and never want to come back.

666
40:07.360 --> 40:08.610
So which is it?

667
40:08.670 --> 40:09.900
Did you want me to come back

668
40:10.230 --> 40:11.530
or not?

669
40:14.280 --> 40:15.120
Whatever you do,

670
40:15.120 --> 40:16.420
you always manage to upset me.

671
40:18.710 --> 40:20.340
So I should've minded my own business?

672
40:20.760 --> 40:22.260
Someone's clearly powerful enough

673
40:22.510 --> 40:23.840
to get by without my help.

674
40:23.920 --> 40:25.610
Fine. I'll stay far away from you

675
40:25.800 --> 40:26.610
so I won't upset you again.

676
40:40.960 --> 40:42.900
I know you were worried about me, too.

677
40:43.960 --> 40:44.880
You never say what you really mean.

678
40:44.880 --> 40:45.740
But I won't hold it against you.

679
40:46.190 --> 40:48.380
Can we stop arguing, please?

680
40:51.480 --> 40:52.940
I made a deal with Youyou.

681
40:53.400 --> 40:55.340
If I help her win over the man she loves

682
40:55.360 --> 40:55.940
and marry him,

683
40:56.230 --> 40:57.490
she'll lend us the talisman

684
40:57.490 --> 40:58.210
to send us back.

685
40:59.460 --> 41:01.940
But you know

686
41:02.440 --> 41:04.170
I can't always rely on my powers.

687
41:04.550 --> 41:05.980
They work one moment and fail the next.

688
41:06.590 --> 41:07.650
So...

689
41:08.590 --> 41:10.180
I needed someone powerful on my side.

690
41:12.590 --> 41:14.010
And you made me your protector?

691
41:14.280 --> 41:15.980
Well, Youyou's afraid of you.

692
41:16.800 --> 41:17.570
So...

693
41:17.920 --> 41:19.980
I may have made our relationship

694
41:20.280 --> 41:23.340
sound just a little more romantic.

695
41:26.280 --> 41:27.900
I told her...

696
41:29.110 --> 41:32.740
I said you were...

697
41:35.320 --> 41:36.170
wrapped around my little finger.

698
41:38.030 --> 41:39.340
What does that mean?

699
41:43.910 --> 41:44.740
It means

700
41:45.800 --> 41:47.130
you can't resist my charms

701
41:47.430 --> 41:48.490
and you're madly in love

702
41:49.280 --> 41:49.780
with me.

703
41:56.400 --> 41:57.260
Then tell me,

704
41:58.400 --> 41:59.130
how should I play along?

705
42:01.440 --> 42:02.340
Well...

706
42:05.760 --> 42:06.820
Like those inner disciples

707
42:06.880 --> 42:07.740
around Su Hexiang?

708
42:08.630 --> 42:09.530
Always flattering her?

709
42:11.190 --> 42:12.260
Or perhaps

710
42:12.920 --> 42:14.980
I should come running whenever you call,

711
42:15.510 --> 42:16.650
ready to live or die for you?

712
42:16.840 --> 42:17.910
Or we could do what we did last time,

713
42:17.910 --> 42:19.100
put on an act for Yuwen Hao,

714
42:19.100 --> 42:20.530
and fool them the same way?

715
42:20.550 --> 42:21.010
I...

716
42:25.230 --> 42:26.460
Don't fall. Go on.

717
42:35.110 --> 42:35.900
What are you staring at?

718
42:38.560 --> 42:39.360
Master!

719
42:52.720 --> 42:53.810
I know you love sweets,

720
42:53.840 --> 42:54.780
so I bought these just for you.

721
42:55.190 --> 42:57.050
After all, we're the best of friends.

722
42:58.070 --> 42:59.460
Never celebrated New Year's Eve.

723
43:00.070 --> 43:00.980
Never even seen snow.

724
43:02.230 --> 43:03.690
[Moonwatch Tower] Qi Fengyin, come see the snow!

725
43:42.940 --> 43:48.700
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

726
43:50.180 --> 43:55.820
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

727
43:56.460 --> 44:03.340
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

728
44:03.460 --> 44:09.380
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

729
44:10.900 --> 44:16.540
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

730
44:18.220 --> 44:23.900
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

731
44:24.220 --> 44:28.660
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

732
44:28.780 --> 44:31.740
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

733
44:31.860 --> 44:37.580
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

734
44:38.420 --> 44:40.860
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

735
44:40.860 --> 44:45.460
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

736
44:45.460 --> 44:47.820
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

737
44:47.820 --> 44:52.020
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

738
44:52.260 --> 44:54.540
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

739
44:54.540 --> 44:56.340
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

740
44:56.340 --> 44:59.260
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

741
44:59.260 --> 45:01.420
♪Before all splendor fades♪

742
45:01.420 --> 45:06.060
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

743
45:06.580 --> 45:08.980
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

744
45:09.020 --> 45:13.620
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

745
45:13.620 --> 45:15.980
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

746
45:16.020 --> 45:20.180
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

747
45:20.420 --> 45:22.700
♪As seas turn to fields♪

748
45:22.700 --> 45:24.500
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

749
45:24.500 --> 45:27.420
♪Together, we'll break free of the cocoon fate has spun♪

750
45:27.420 --> 45:29.540
♪Before all splendor fades♪

751
45:29.540 --> 45:38.580
